@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.CharisOpeningModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "CHARIS Opening";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <!-- HERO -->
        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Collaborations & Campaigns</p>
                <h2>CHARIS Opening</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A school orientation collaboration where Kopi Cinta introduced Deaf awareness
                    through free drinks, sign language, and meaningful student interaction.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>School Collaboration</span>
                    <span>Deaf Awareness</span>
                    <span>Sign Language</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="event-hero-img">
                <img src="/images/charis/IMG-20240717-WA0007.jpg" alt="Kopi Cinta booth at CHARIS Opening">
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- OPENING QUOTE -->
        <div class="hbii-quote reveal">
            <p>
                “A simple drink order became a first step into understanding,
                curiosity, and connection.”
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 1 -->
        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">Where It Began</p>
                <h3>Sharing LOVE at CHARIS</h3>

                <p>
                    During a school orientation event at CHARIS, a local school in Malang,
                    Kopi Cinta began a meaningful step in sharing LOVE with students.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Through this collaboration, a simple booth became a space for curiosity,
                    interaction, and awareness.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>What We Brought</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Free beverages for students</li>
                    <li>Sign language ordering</li>
                    <li>Visual learning guides</li>
                    <li>Deaf awareness campaign</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- IMAGE BREAK -->
        <div class="featured-grid reveal">
            <img src="/images/charis/IMG-20240717-WA0007.jpg" alt="Students gathered around Kopi Cinta booth">
            <img src="/images/charis/IMG-20240717-WA0011.jpg" alt="Kopi Cinta drinks prepared for students">
            <img src="/images/charis/IMG-20240717-WA0021.jpg" alt="Kopi Cinta team at CHARIS">
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 2 -->
        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">The Concept</p>
                <h3>Order With Sign Language</h3>

                <p>
                    Through free beverages for all students, Kopi Cinta introduced
                    a Deaf awareness campaign in a simple and approachable way.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The concept was clear: order using sign language, and receive
                    a drink for free.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Learning Support</p>
                <h3>Visual Guides for Students</h3>

                <p>
                    To make the activity easier to understand, visual guides were provided
                    so students could learn quickly before ordering.
                </p>

                <p>
                    These guides helped turn the ordering process into something fun,
                    interactive, and memorable.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 3 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/charis/Hallo semua👋👋 Salam kenal, kami dari kopi CINTA❤️Mulai hari ini dan seterusnya kami berkomitm.webp" alt="Kopi Cinta sign language campaign board">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>Natural Interaction</h3>

                <p>
                    Throughout the process, meaningful moments emerged naturally
                    between Deaf and hearing participants.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Students began interacting with the team, trying sign language,
                    asking questions, and experiencing communication in a new way.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 4 -->
        <div class="hbii-block reverse reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">Awareness</p>
                <h3>Curiosity Became Understanding</h3>

                <p>
                    From there, students became more curious about the Deaf community—
                    how to communicate, introduce themselves, and learn sign language.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Their curiosity grew from the alphabet to simple everyday words,
                    creating a memorable first step toward understanding.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-highlight-panel">
                <div>
                    <strong>Try</strong>
                    <span>Students practiced sign language.</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Ask</strong>
                    <span>Curiosity opened new conversations.</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Connect</strong>
                    <span>Interaction became awareness.</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CLOSING -->
        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>A Positive Beginning</h3>

            <p>
                The event received very positive responses, both for the drinks
                and for the campaign message behind the activity.
            </p>

            <p>
                This collaboration encouraged Kopi Cinta to continue spreading LOVE
                through more initiatives, up until today.
            </p>
        </div>

        <br />

        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Collaborations</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>